    "## 4. Phase Diagram\n",
    "\n",
    "A phase diagram in $(k, c)$ space visualises the saddle-path structure. The two **nullclines** are:\n",
    "- $\\dot{k} = 0$: $c = f(k) - (\\delta + n)k$ — the **resource constraint locus**\n",
    "- $\\dot{c} = 0$: $f'(k) = \\delta + \\rho$ — a vertical line at $k^*$ (since $f'(k) = A$ is constant)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c5d6e7f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "k_grid = np.linspace(0.01, 2.2, 400)\n",
    "c_null_k = A * k_grid - (delta + n) * k_grid   # k-dot = 0 locus\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Nullclines ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "ax.plot(k_grid, c_null_k, \"#7C3AED\", linewidth=2, linestyle=\"-\",\n",
    "        label=r\"$\\dot{k}=0$ locus: $c = f(k)-(\\delta+n)k$\")\n",
    "ax.axvline(k_star, color=\"#D97706\", linewidth=2, linestyle=\"-\",\n",
    "           label=r\"$\\dot{c}=0$ locus: $k = k^*$\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Saddle path ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "ax.plot(k_opt[:300], c_opt[:300], \"#2563EB\", linewidth=2.5, label=\"Saddle path (optimal)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Off-path trajectories ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
